---
description: Require matched before-and-after evidence for visual UI changes
alwaysApply: true
---

# Visual evidence

- For every visual UI change, capture the same app state and input before and after at both mobile and desktop viewports.
- Show the resulting images inline in the final handoff, not only as filesystem paths or preview links.
- Run the repository render audit on every frame before sharing it.
- Clearly call out when a changed surface genuinely does not exist at one viewport, and show every applicable viewport.
- Keep `You test` as `Nothing` for visual checks Codex can drive itself.
